OL,3,GNEWSAEight teens arrested after
OL,4,Aderelict building fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight teenagers have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson following a fire in
OL,8,Fa derelict building.
OL,10,FHampshire Fire and Rescue Service crews
OL,11,Ffrom Andover, Sutton Scotney and
OL,12,FWinchester were called to the blaze on
OL,13,FAndover's High Street at about 15:15
OL,14,FBST on Monday.
OL,16,FIt took them about four hours,
OL,17,Falongside firefighters from Dorset &
OL,18,FWiltshire Fire and Rescue Service, to
OL,19,Fput out the fire, which involved debris
OL,20,Fbetween the ground and first floors.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
